<p>Hello <%= @resource.email %>,</p>

<p>We received a request to reset your Railtor password. You can complete the
reset by clicking the button below:</p>

<p>
  <% web_app_url = Rails.application.config.x.web_app_url %>
  <% reset_link = "#{web_app_url}/reset-password?token=#{@token}" %>
  <a href="<%= reset_link %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 16px;background:#4338ca;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px;font-weight:600;">
    Reset password
  </a>
</p>

<p>If you did not request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

<p>&mdash; The Railtor Team</p>
